<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on German auto basket.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on German auto basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schweizerischer Bankverein (Deutschland) AG has issued two million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on a German auto basket, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>The basket includes one share of BMW AG, ten shares of Daimler Benz AG and two shares of Volkswagen AG.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 29.JAN.97 02.SEP.97   PAYDATE	28.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, DUSS	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REF  3709 DEM     ONE BASKET CONTROLLED BY 100 WARRANTS</p>
<p>* * * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	   STRIKE	 ISSUE	 PREMIUM     GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	   3600 DEM     3.02 DEM    5.2 PCT     12.3 X</p>
<p> CALL	   3800 DEM     2.04 DEM    8.0 PCT     18.2 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
